EU directives on energy‑saving equipment have nudged manufacturers to certify passive heat pipe heat exchangers for a broader range of temperature zones, expanding their eligibility in commercial building codes and automotive emissions standards.
Channel Partnerships
Leading European distributors are bundling heat‑pipe exchangers with control‑system packages, creating a single‑source offering that simplifies procurement for large‑scale industrial clients.
